WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:19.650
Hi there! Who are you?

2
00:00:19.651 --> 00:00:23.554
I'm a Siberian tiger.

3
00:00:23.555 --> 00:00:27.579
Tigers are the largest cats on earth.

4
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.333
Where do you live?

5
00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:34.906
Siberian tigers live in Asia.

6
00:00:34.907 --> 00:00:39.031
We make our homes in forests.

7
00:00:39.032 --> 00:00:41.953
Can you swim?

8
00:00:41.954 --> 00:00:46.097
All tigers are great swimmers!

9
00:00:46.098 --> 00:00:50.560
We're the only big cats that like water.

10
00:00:50.561 --> 00:00:53.876
I like your stripes.

11
00:00:53.877 --> 00:00:58.458
Each tiger's stripes are different.

12
00:00:58.459 --> 00:01:03.136
Our stripes help us hide in the forest.

13
00:01:03.137 --> 00:01:07.345
Then our prey can't see us!

14
00:01:07.346 --> 00:01:10.051
What do you eat?

15
00:01:10.052 --> 00:01:15.126
We hunt big animals like elk and bears.

16
00:01:15.127 --> 00:01:18.873
We usually hunt at night.

17
00:01:18.874 --> 00:01:24.015
We can see very well in the dark.

18
00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:27.380
Are you dangerous?

19
00:01:27.381 --> 00:01:31.769
We have sharp teeth and claws.

20
00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:37.560
Our roars are very loud.

21
00:01:37.561 --> 00:01:42.461
But we usually stay away from people.

22
00:01:42.462 --> 00:01:46.604
Do you live with other tigers?

23
00:01:46.605 --> 00:01:52.711
Nope! We stay away from each other.

24
00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:57.235
We like to be alone.

25
00:01:57.236 --> 00:02:01.155
It's getting dark—time to eat.

26
00:02:01.156 --> 00:02:03.483
Good-bye!

27
00:02:03.484 --> 00:02:12.074
Good-bye, Siberian Tiger!
